#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "56_Owner"
msgid "Hi, welcome! Ah, if it isn't Akiyama-san."
msgstr "¡Hola, bienvenido! Ey, pero si es Akiyama-san."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "68_Akiyama"
msgid "Hi there. I think you got a call from Hana-chan, right? So\\r\nhow did Shoko-san do?"
msgstr "Buenas. Creo que Hana-chan te llamó, ¿verdad?\n¿Qué tal le fue a Shoko-san?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "80_Owner"
msgid "I have some great tuna today, so I recommended the otoro.\\r\nBut wouldn't you know it? All she ate was the daily special\\r\nbefore going on her way."
msgstr "Ah, el atún de hoy era exquisito, así que le recomendé que comiera otoro. Lo raro aquí es que solo se pidió el menú del día. Luego de eso, se fue."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "92_Akiyama"
msgid "How much is the special?"
msgstr "¿Cuánto cuesta ese menú?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "104_Owner"
msgid "980 yen."
msgstr "980 yenes."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "116_Akiyama"
msgid "Wow, cheap! Can I have one?"
msgstr "¡¡Pero qué barato!! ¡Yo también quiero uno!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "128_Owner"
msgid "All sold out, I'm afraid. But, you know, she was a little\\r\noff today. She usually only eats uni, awabi－you know, the\\r\npricey stuff. What's going on?"
msgstr "Me temo que ya se acabaron. Pero sabe, esa chica estaba rara hoy. Usualmente solo come uni, awabi, ya sabes, las cosas caras. ¿Le estará pasando algo?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "140_Akiyama"
msgid "Hmm. So I guess she hasn't touched that million yen, then."
msgstr "Mmm, ya veo. Supongo que aún no ha tocado el millón de yenes."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "152_Owner"
msgid "Wait, what? When Hana-chan told me to make her spend\\r\nmoney... Hey, is this another one of your tests?"
msgstr "¿Qué? Entonces, cuando me pidieron que le hiciera gastar dinero... Un momento, ¿no será esto otra de tus \"pruebas\"?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "164_Akiyama"
msgid "Something like that. Thanks for your help. I'll have to drop\\r\nby again soon."
msgstr "Algo así. Gracias por su ayuda. Ya vendré en otra ocasión."

